q 0 g BT 31.19 605.03 Td (1.) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 605.03 Td (\(1 point\) What is CAP Theorem?) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 590.86 Td (A\) No distributed systems can be scalable as well as consistent ) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 576.69 Td (B\) MongoDB cannot be scalable ) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 562.51 Td (C\) A distributed system can meet only two of the following: consistency, availability, and errors tolerance) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 548.34 Td (D\) A relational database cannot meet the requirements of big data
) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 31.19 519.99 Td (2.) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 519.99 Td (\(1 point\) What is isolation property for a distributed system?) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 505.82 Td (A\) All transactions must be done sequentially one by one) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 491.65 Td (B\) All transactions should lead to the same result whether they are performed concurrently or sequentially ) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 477.47 Td (C\) All transactions can be performed concurrently) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 463.30 Td (D\) All transactions must all succeed or fail as a whole
) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 31.19 434.95 Td (3.) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 434.95 Td (\(1 point\) Using JSON, each document is a list of key-value pairs. How do you enter a order data value like) Tj ET Q
