q 0 g BT 59.53 406.61 Td (A\) OrderDate: new Date\(\)) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 392.43 Td (B\) "OrderDate": ISODate\("2009-12-23"\)) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 378.26 Td (C\) Order Date: new Date\(2009, 12, 23\)) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 364.09 Td (D\) OrderDate: ISODate\(2009, 12, 23\)
) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 31.19 335.74 Td (4.) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 335.74 Td (\(1 point\) How do you specify the value for for _id field of a document?) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 321.57 Td (A\) _id: 12345) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 307.39 Td (B\) "_id":ObjectId\("12345"\)) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 293.22 Td (C\) _id:ObjectID\(12345\)) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 279.05 Td (D\) _id:"12345"
) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 31.19 250.70 Td (5.) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 250.70 Td (\(1 point\) How does MongoDB store a large document such as a photo or video file which is over 200MB?) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 236.53 Td (A\) use GridFS) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 222.35 Td (B\) use replication ) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 208.18 Td (C\) use sharding) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 194.01 Td (D\) cannot be stored because the file is over 16 MB limit
) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 31.19 165.66 Td (6.) Tj ET Q
